<title>USA: Arvin Industries Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Arvin Industries Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ind. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.37		    $0.04</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.36		    $0.04</p>
<p> Net			  8,300		    1,000</p>
<p> Revs		     557,100		  462,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	22,592		   22,386</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	24,879		   25,090</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago Q3 includes $1.7 million or $0.08 a share loss from discontinued operations, making oper shr $0.12.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.26		    $0.52</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.23		    $0.52</p>
<p> Net			 28,300		   11,600</p>
<p> Revs		   1,652,000		1,465,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	22,458		   22,374</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	24,715		   25,242</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1995 results include $400,000 income from discontinued operations and $700,000 income from disposal of discontinued operations, or a total of $0.05 a share. Nine-month 1995 earnings from continuing operations were $0.47 a share.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
